---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Programming Semester 2 - Lessons">
    <div style="max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem;">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
            <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0; color: #111827;">Semester 2: AI Vision + Advanced Robotics</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0; color: #4b5563;">Lessons focused on the miniAuto platform, computer vision demos, and advanced robotics concepts.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: white; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin-bottom: 2rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0; color: #111827;">Where this starts</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; color: #374151;">
                Semester 2 begins with safe remote control, then transitions into the ESP32-S3 Vision Module.
                The first goal of the vision unit is simply to get the live camera feed working reliably.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
            <div style="background: white; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
                <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0; color: #111827;">Core Vision Unit (Hiwonder Ch. 7)</h2>
                <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.9; color: #374151;">
                    <li><a href="/programming/lessons32/Lesson18" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">Lesson 18: Live Camera Feed (Hiwonder 7.3)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/programming/lessons32/Lesson19" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">Lesson 19: Color Recognition (Hiwonder 7.4)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/programming/lessons32/Lesson20" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">Lesson 20: Color Tracking (Hiwonder 7.5)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/programming/lessons32/Lesson21" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">Lesson 21: Vision Line Following (Hiwonder 7.6)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/programming/lessons32/Lesson22" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">Lesson 22: Face Recognition (Hiwonder 7.7)</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div style="background: white; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
                <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0; color: #111827;">Bridge + Advanced Concepts</h2>
                <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.9; color: #374151;">
                    <li><a href="/programming/lessons32/Lesson17" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">Lesson 17: App Remote Control (Hiwonder 6.10)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/programming/lessons32/Lesson23" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">Lesson 23: Robot Swarms and Multi-Agent Systems</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/programming/lessons32/Lesson24" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">Lesson 24: Face Recognition and Biometric Systems</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/programming/lessons32/Lesson25" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">Lesson 25: Autonomous Navigation and Path Planning</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1rem; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px;">
            <a href="/programming/" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; background: #059669; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;">
                ← Course Overview
            </a>

            <a href="/programming/lessons32/Lesson18" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; background: #667eea; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;">
                Start Semester 2: Lesson 18 →
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
